flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B{Customer Exists?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Search Customer]
    B -->|No| D[New Customer Registration]
    
    C --> E[Select Customer from Database]
    D --> F[Enter Customer Details]
    F --> G[Save to Customer Database]
    G --> H[Customer Selected]
    E --> H
    
    H --> I[Service Selection Screen]
    I --> J[Select Repair Type]
    J --> K[Enter Quantity]
    K --> L[Calculate Price]
    
    L --> M[Add Customer Notes]
    M --> N[Preview Bill & Label]
    N --> O{Confirm?}
    O -->|No| N
    O -->|Yes| P[Print Label]
    
    P --> Q[Save Transaction]
    Q --> R[End]
    
    subgraph Database
    DB1[(Customer Database)]
    DB2[(Service Types Database)]
    DB3[(Transactions Database)]
    end
    
    D -.-> DB1
    G -.-> DB1
    C -.-> DB1
    J -.-> DB2
    Q -.-> DB3